### Developer V1 REST API Tests (API Key Authentication)
### All requests use: Authorization: Bearer nxqr_live_...
@base = http://localhost:3001
@contentType = Content-Type: application/json
@apiKey = nxqr_live_YOUR_API_KEY_HERE
@qrId = PASTE_QR_ID_HERE

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# SECTION 1 — AUTHENTICATION
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### 1.1 Valid API key
# EXPECT: 200
GET {{base}}/v1/qr?page=1&limit=1
Authorization: Bearer {{apiKey}}

###

### 1.2 No authorization header
# EXPECT: 401 "Valid API key required"
GET {{base}}/v1/qr

###

### 1.3 JWT token (not API key) on v1 route
# EXPECT: 401 (JWT starts with "ey...", not "nxqr_live_")
GET {{base}}/v1/qr
Authorization: Bearer PASTE_JWT_TOKEN_HERE

###

### 1.4 Revoked API key
# EXPECT: 401
# (First revoke the key from dashboard /app/api-keys, then try)
GET {{base}}/v1/qr
Authorization: Bearer nxqr_live_revoked_key_here

###

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# SECTION 2 — QR CRUD VIA V1 API
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### 2.1 List QR codes
# EXPECT: 200, data array, meta.total
GET {{base}}/v1/qr?page=1&limit=10
Authorization: Bearer {{apiKey}}

###

### 2.2 List with search
GET {{base}}/v1/qr?search=test&page=1&limit=10
Authorization: Bearer {{apiKey}}

###

### 2.3 Get single QR
GET {{base}}/v1/qr/{{qrId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{apiKey}}

###

### 2.4 Create QR code via API key
# EXPECT: 201
POST {{base}}/v1/qr
Authorization: Bearer {{apiKey}}
{{contentType}}

{
  "name": "API-Created QR",
  "type": "URL",
  "category": "DYNAMIC",
  "content": { "data": { "url": "https://api-test.example.com" } },
  "tags": ["api", "test"]
}

###

### 2.5 Update destination URL
PATCH {{base}}/v1/qr/{{qrId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{apiKey}}
{{contentType}}

{
  "content": { "data": { "url": "https://new-destination.example.com" } }
}

###

### 2.6 Toggle active state
# EXPECT: 200, isActive flips
PATCH {{base}}/v1/qr/{{qrId}}/toggle
Authorization: Bearer {{apiKey}}

###

### 2.7 Delete QR code
# EXPECT: 204
DELETE {{base}}/v1/qr/{{qrId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{apiKey}}

###

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# SECTION 3 — PLAN GATING
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# The v1 API requires a PRO plan or higher.
# Test with a FREE plan API key (if you have one):

### 3.1 Free plan key on v1 API
# EXPECT: 403 "Plan upgrade required"
GET {{base}}/v1/qr
Authorization: Bearer nxqr_live_FREE_PLAN_KEY_HERE

###

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# SECTION 4 — RATE LIMITING (300 req/min per API key)
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Run this shell snippet to trigger the rate limit:
#
#   for i in $(seq 1 305); do
#     curl -s -o /dev/null -w "%{http_code}\n" \
#       -H "Authorization: Bearer nxqr_live_YOUR_KEY" \
#       http://localhost:3001/v1/qr?page=1&limit=1
#   done
#
# EXPECT: First 300 responses are 200, then 429

### 4.1 Check rate limit headers
# Look for: RateLimit-Limit: 300, RateLimit-Remaining: N, RateLimit-Reset: timestamp
GET {{base}}/v1/qr?page=1&limit=1
Authorization: Bearer {{apiKey}}

###
